      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِمَالَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>occupation,</i> or <i>business, of a porter,</i>
or <i>carrier of burdens.</i> (M, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also said to
